CARTAUDIT — MASTER UI/UX TRANSFORMATION

Premium Product Experience | Complete Layout & Information Architecture Redesign

You are working on an existing, fully functional application called CartAudit — Smart Budget Radar.

Your task is to transform its user interface and user experience into a premium, polished, intuitive, modern financial application.

This is a substantial redesign of the existing application's layout, information architecture, component composition, spacing, hierarchy, navigation and interaction design.

This is NOT a rebuild. This is NOT a feature-reduction exercise. This is NOT a theme redesign.

The objective is to make the existing product dramatically easier to understand, navigate and use while preserving every existing capability.

